# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private workspace content — NEVER commit.
#
# A workspace holds real stakeholder names, influence assessments, political
# notes, strategy documents, risk registers and finished deliverables. That is
# exactly the material that must stay on your own machine.
#
# Patterns are anchored with a leading "/" so they match only at the repo root
# and cannot accidentally swallow templates/workspace/, which must ship.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/executive-workspace/
/workspace/
/workspaces/
/*-workspace/

# Workspace runtime state, wherever a workspace is created inside the repo
.situation-board/
/.esb/
/.gtd/

# Deliverables and source documents — never part of the source tree
*.pptx
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pdf

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
/dist/
/server/dist/
/ui/dist/
/native/whisper-helper/build/

# Logs and caches
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.eslintcache
node-compile-cache/

# Editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# npm artifacts
*.tgz

# Personal notes for AI coding agents (see AGENTS.md); never commit them
/AGENTS.local.md
/CLAUDE.local.md
